---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Demonstrations - Dasher">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="section">
      <h1>Dasher Demonstrations</h1>

      <div class="demo-nav">
        <a href="/docs/getting-started/how-to/tips/">Tips for Novices</a>
        <span class="separator">|</span>
        <a href="/docs/">Documentation</a>
      </div>

      <section class="demo-section">
        <h2>How Dasher Works</h2>
        <p>
          The image below shows the state of the Dasher interface while the user is writing the word "objection".
          Alternative words that could easily be written at this point include "objective", "objects_", and "object_oriented".
        </p>
        <div class="demo-image-container">
          <img src="/images/object.gif" alt="Dasher text entry interface showing word selection" width="507" height="447" loading="lazy" />
        </div>

        <p class="demo-note">
          If you find Dasher hard to imagine based on these static pictures, please take a look at the animations below.
          <strong>When you watch someone else steering Dasher, you may find it looks difficult, but be assured:
          it is actually very easy; it's a lot like driving a car.</strong>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="demo-section">
        <h2>Animated Demonstrations</h2>
        <p>These animated GIFs show Dasher in action and should work in any modern browser.</p>

        <div class="demo-grid">
          <div class="demo-card">
            <h3>Dasher Version 3</h3>
            <div class="demo-media">
              <img src="/videos/newdasher.gif" alt="Animated demonstration of Dasher version 3" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <p class="demo-size">~300KB</p>
          </div>

          <div class="demo-card">
            <h3>Daishoya (Japanese Dasher)</h3>
            <div class="demo-media">
              <img src="/videos/anim-japanese.gif" alt="Animated demonstration of Japanese Dasher" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <p class="demo-size">~300KB</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="demo-section">
        <h2>Video Demonstrations</h2>
        <p>Longer video demonstrations with commentary and various input methods.</p>

        <div class="video-list">
          <div class="video-item">
            <h3>Dasher with Eye-Tracking (Enhanced Mode)</h3>
            <p>Demonstrating autocalibration within ten seconds of a miscalibrated eyetracker.</p>
            <div class="video-player">
              <video controls preload="none" width="640">
                <source src="/videos/DasherEyetracker.mpg" type="video/mpeg" />
                <p>Your browser doesn't support video playback. <a href="/videos/DasherEyetracker.mpg">Download the video</a> (17MB)</p>
              </video>
            </div>
            <p class="demo-size">~17MB</p>
          </div>

          <div class="video-item">
            <h3>High-Resolution Eye-Tracking</h3>
            <p>Enhanced eyetracking mode demonstration at higher resolution.</p>
            <div class="video-player">
              <video controls preload="none" width="640">
                <source src="/videos/EyeDasher.4800.mpg" type="video/mpeg" />
                <p>Your browser doesn't support video playback. <a href="/videos/EyeDasher.4800.mpg">Download the video</a> (27MB)</p>
              </video>
            </div>
            <p class="demo-size">~27MB</p>
          </div>

          <div class="video-item">
            <h3>Control Mode with Eye-Tracking</h3>
            <p>Demonstration of control mode functionality with an eye-tracker.</p>
            <div class="video-player">
              <video controls preload="none" width="640">
                <source src="/videos/ControlMode.mpg" type="video/mpeg" />
                <p>Your browser doesn't support video playback. <a href="/videos/ControlMode.mpg">Download the video</a> (9MB)</p>
              </video>
            </div>
            <p class="demo-size">~9MB</p>
          </div>

          <div class="video-item">
            <h3>Breath Dasher</h3>
            <p>Using Dasher with breath control, including control mode demonstration.</p>
            <div class="video-player">
              <video controls preload="none" width="640">
                <source src="/videos/BreathDasher.mpg" type="video/mpeg" />
                <p>Your browser doesn't support video playback. <a href="/videos/BreathDasher.mpg">Download the video</a> (26MB)</p>
              </video>
            </div>
            <p class="demo-size">~26MB</p>
          </div>

          <div class="video-item">
            <h3>Streaming Demo with Commentary</h3>
            <p>1.5 minute streaming video demonstration including audio commentary.</p>
            <div class="video-player">
              <video controls preload="none" width="640">
                <source src="/videos/20020520_demo.asf" type="video/x-ms-asf" />
                <p>Your browser doesn't support video playback. <a href="/videos/20020520_demo.asf">Download the video</a> (2.7MB)</p>
              </video>
            </div>
            <p class="demo-size">~2.7MB</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="demo-section">
        <h2>External Demonstrations</h2>
        <div class="external-links">
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IK5_QYv3kf0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="external-link">
            <h3>Google Video by Paul Tingey</h3>
            <p>Dasher hooked up to RoboRealm (machine vision software) - "Writing sentences with a red plastic ball"</p>
          </a>

          <a href="https://today.msnbc.msn.com/id/26184891/#29955316" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="external-link">
            <h3>MSNBC Feature</h3>
            <p>Augie, an ALS-sufferer, driving Dasher with his feet</p>
          </a>

          <a href="https://video.google.com/videoplay?docid=5078334075080674416" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="external-link">
            <h3>Google Tech Talk</h3>
            <p>19th April 2007 - "Dasher: information-efficient text entry" by David MacKay at Google Inc (54 minutes)</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="demo-section">
        <h2>More Resources</h2>
        <div class="cta-links">
          <a href="/docs/getting-started/how-to/tips/">Tips for Novices</a>
          <a href="/docs/">Documentation</a>
          <a href="/docs/research/">Research Publications</a>
          <a href="https://matrix.to/#/#dasher:matrix.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Community Chat</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .demo-nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    background-color: var(--color-horizon-mint);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .separator {
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .demo-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .demo-note {
    padding: var(--space-md);
    background-color: var(--color-horizon-mint);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-deep-ink);
  }

  .demo-image-container {
    text-align: center;
    margin: var(--space-md) 0;
  }

  .demo-image-container img {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-deep-ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .demo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .demo-card {
    background-color: var(--color-canvas-white);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-horizon-mint);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-md);
  }

  .demo-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm) 0;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }

  .demo-media {
    text-align: center;
    background-color: var(--color-horizon-mint);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--space-sm);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .demo-media img {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .demo-size {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .video-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .video-item {
    background-color: var(--color-canvas-white);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-horizon-mint);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-md);
  }

  .video-item h3 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs) 0;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }

  .video-item p {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm) 0;
  }

  .video-player {
    background-color: #000;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0;
  }

  .video-player video {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 480px;
  }

  .external-links {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .external-link {
    display: block;
    background-color: var(--color-canvas-white);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-horizon-mint);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--color-deep-ink);
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
  }

  .external-link:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-target-coral);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .external-link h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs) 0;
  }

  .external-link p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .cta-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .cta-links a {
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    background-color: var(--color-horizon-mint);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--color-deep-ink);
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
  }

  .cta-links a:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-target-coral);
    color: var(--color-canvas-white);
  }

  a {
    color: var(--color-deep-ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  a:hover {
    color: var(--color-target-coral);
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-target-coral);
  }
</style>
